rohitjoins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"rohitjoins","id":32570096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTcwMDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32570096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins","html_url":"https://github.com/rohitjoins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2022-06-22T00:18:58Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T14:51:39Z","closed_at":"2022-07-13T18:54:35Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### ExoPlayer Version\n\n2.18.0\n\n### Devices that reproduce the issue\n\nN/A\n\n### Devices that do not reproduce the issue\n\nN/A\n\n### Reproducible in the demo app?\n\nNot tested\n\n### Reproduction steps\n\nAttempt to play an MP4 or MKV file with an HEVC stream having bit 6 set to 1 in the first byte of a NAL array in an `HEVCDecoderConfigurationRecord`.\n\n### Expected result\n\nHevcConfig.parse() should read the low 6 bits of the first byte to correctly determine the NAL type for each array.\n\n### Actual result\n\nInstead, it reads the low _7_ bits, incorrectly including the reserved bit. This is currently meant to always be 0, but could be given some kind of meaning in a future revision. This is very minor, but I happened to notice it while investigating another issue in the area, and figured I'd bring it up.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/03569f9e6536e6c60cb585115d6d7352a4deab71/library/extractor/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/video/HevcConfig.java#L66\r\n\r\n```\r\nint nalUnitType = data.readUnsignedByte() & 0x7F; // completeness (1), nal_unit_type (7)\r\n```\r\nshould instead be:\r\n```\r\nint nalUnitType = data.readUnsignedByte() & 0x3F; // completeness (1), reserved (1), nal_unit_type (6)\r\n```\n\n### Media\n\nSynthetic test clip attached: [test-clip.mp4.zip](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/files/8953476/test-clip.mp4.zip)\n\n### Bug Report\n\n- [ ] You will email the zip file produced by `adb bugreport` to dev.exoplayer@gmail.com after filing this issue.","closed_by":{"login":"rohitjoins","id":32570096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTcwMDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32570096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins","html_url":"https://github.com/rohitjoins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohitjoins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/10366/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}